0..74 Comment "// The string operations of the `string` namespace: containment, equality,"
75..150 Comment "// prefix and suffix, escaping and splitting. The native `string` namespace"
151..229 Comment "// holds `append`, `eq` and `lt` (`simple-builtins.gandr`), so the others name"
230..300 Comment "// no member of it; scanning and escaping are planned text primitives."
301..372 Comment "// Equality is written `==`, which resolves the prelude\'s `Eq` model of"
373..426 Comment "// strings; their order is written `<`, through `Ord`"
427..450 Comment "// (`model-ord.gandr`)."
451..453 Comment "//"
454..468 Comment "// - see: #318"
